      "updated_at": "2025-12-03T20:03:47Z",
      "body": "As far as I can tell, the code is finalized and ready to be merged. The [original PR](https://github.com/seerr-team/seerr/pull/1238) for Jellyseerr (and by extension, the `preview-music-support` tag) has been around for a year with minimal changes, but has been on the backburner as Overseerrr and Jellyseerr combine their codebase to become Seerr. There have been many people, including myself, who have been using that branch without issue and it's widely considered stable.\n\nThe original Jellyseerr PR was [rebased on the new Seerr code](https://github.com/seerr-team/seerr/pull/2132) with minimal changes, and they are planning to use it in Seerr, but it's literally at [the bottom of their TODO list](https://github.com/seerr-team/seerr/issues/926) for review/merging.\n\nSo, I can say with a lot of confidence that the current API for Lidarr support will remain the same when it's merged.\n\n> You can contribute the change if you want to.\n\nI would like to, but I have minimal experience with web dev, zero experience with Vite, and I have no clue how to run or debug this project, so I wouldn't be able to submit anything (even a small change like this) with confidence as I have no idea how to test my changes and ensure nothing broke. ",
      "author_association": "NONE",
      "pin": null,
